                                "sense_id": "6b0c73d5-b009-3094-bfbb-744830d88b78",
                                "text": "Frère Jacques, Frère Jacques\nDormez-vous ? Dormez-vous ?\nSonnez les matines ! Sonnez les matines !\nDing, dang, dong. Ding, dang, dong.",
                                "translation": "Brother Jacques, Brother Jacques\nAre you asleep? Are you asleep?\nRing the bells for matins! Ring the bells for matins!\nDing, dang, dong. Ding, dang, dong.",
